rouble is unwelcome]","bold_text_offsets":[[3,12]],"type":"example","id":"8597cec3-bf6c-45c8-84f8-53506f8dc6d7"},{"text":"a book about my loiterings in Europe","bold_text_offsets":[[16,26]],"type":"example","id":"ba5701f2-5cbb-4520-b8a4-56a1bb59baa8"},{"text":"When, however, drivers are registering net gains of 12, 13 and 14 min. on a schedule of 99 min. from Leicester to St. Pancras, there has clearly been no loitering on the way!","ref":"1959 September 15, O. S. Nock, “British Locomotive Practice and Performance”, in Railway Magazine, pages 626-627:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[153,162]],"id":"098982f9-ee8d-400b-b246-a370b0ca4c04"}],"links":[["loiter","loiter#English"]],"categories":["English terms with collocations","English terms with quotations","English terms with usage examples"],"glosses":["The action of the verb loiter."],"tags":["countable","uncountable"],"id":"40ababda-a026-4889-99c1-b993930ded9f"}],"related":[{"word":"idling"},{"word":"loafing"}],"synonyms":[]},"Loire":{"id":"6abd1a79-6d39-4179-b372-8597a6e869c1","word":"Loire","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"river","tags":["masculine"],"word":"Loire"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"river","tags":["masculine"],"word":"Líger"}],"pos":"name","tags":null,"senses":[{"categories":["en:Places in Allier, France","en:Places in Ardèche, France","en:Places in Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes, France","en:Places in Bourgogne-Franche-Comté, France","en:Places in Centre-Val de Loire, France","en:Places in Cher, France","en:Places in France","en:Places in Haute-Loire, France","en:Places in Indre-et-Loire, France","en:Places in Loir-et-Cher, France","en:Places in Loire, France","en:Places in Loire-Atlantique, France","en:Places in Loiret, France","en:Places in Maine-et-Loire, France","en:Places in Nièvre, France","en:Places in Pays de la Loire, France","en:Places in Saône-et-Loire, France","en:Rivers in Allier, France","en:Rivers in Ardèche, France","en:R